	)
	(text "Power-up (JESD209-5 Table 19 / 20): nothing starts until both host rails are up;\nVDD1 first, VDD2H ramps 3.3 ms behind it, VDDQ follows the VDD2H power good.\nPower-off: 1.2 V first: VDD2H follows, PG disables U4, R508 pulls VDDQ down, VDD1 falls last.\n\nNot connected: VPP (2.5 V), VTT, VREFCA.  No SPD EEPROM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9053b14a-5633-5deb-b371-5b7b2c228d1e")
	)
	(text "Sequence: VDD1 (enabled by V1P2) -> VDD2H = VDD2L (enabled by VDD1, soft start) -> VDDQ (enabled by the VDD2H power good)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 21.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "93431037-d692-5db2-a9da-5a02a6aac2d9")
	)
	(text "VOUT = 0.4 V x (1 + R506 / R507) = 0.4996 V.\nEN = PG_VDD2H: VDDQ starts when U2 reports power good.\nR508 (22 R) discharges VDDQ after U4 is disabled, time constant 0.93 ms."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 204.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aa356ecd-01e3-5f2a-828a-995d680b5428")
	)
	(text "VDD2H = VDD2L  1.048 V  (U2 TPS74801DRCRM3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b4447c87-c6b9-58aa-bbbe-88ea64bc95fd")
	)
	(text "VOUT = 0.8 V x (1 + R501 / R502) = 1.048 V, +/-1 % (new die,\n    guaranteed by the M3 suffix).\nEN = VDD1.  C504 (2.2 nF): 3.3 ms soft start.  PG (open drain,\n    10 k to V3P3) enables U4.\nU2 pins stacked in the symbol: 2 on 1 (IN), 10 on 9 (OUT), 11\n    = exposed pad on 6 (GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d5083da6-6cc8-59ce-a9cd-3661ae9e154d")
	)
	(text "EN = V1P2 through 47 k: VDD1 cannot rise before the host 1.2 V rail.\nR509 (47 k) empties VDD1 after power-off (no output discharge in U3).\nU3 pin 4 (NC) is not drawn and stays open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 54.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d5143dd3-ac10-5100-9dd5-d8262fe6ba01")
	)
